    "_provider_api_note": "Story 26.5: Reporting v3 is pinned HERE and only here (Content-Type: application/vnd.createasyncreportrequest.v3+json; api_catalog.json / catalog_sources.json api_version must equal this pin -- module test enforces the coupling). The THREE regional hosts are ISOLATED SILOS: a profileId is only valid on its own region's host (cross-region = 4XX). connector.py routes every call on the host of the profile's stored region; discovery fans out over all 3 hosts. Auth = Nango (Login with Amazon, scope advertising::campaign_management); the platform LwA client id is the AMAZON_ADS_CLIENT_ID env var (Amazon-Ads-ClientId header), never per-user.",
