        "window_seconds": 60,
        "budget_points": 30,
        "read_cost": 1,
        "write_cost": 3,
        "_note": "No published fixed rate limits (dossier section 1.6): throttling is dynamic (429 + Retry-After in seconds -> core.quota.RateLimitError(retry_after)) and the reporting endpoints add regional report-queue-size tiers. This conservative local budget (30 points/min, report creation = write cost 3) keeps the breaker ahead of the dynamic governor; real limits are probe-only evidence (ROLLOUT_NOTES.md)."
    },
